# Pairs with NoFalseAbsence. Classify maps an infrastructure fault to Failed
# instead of leaving the intent Pending, so a timeout that struck after the
# commit landed is recorded as a call that changed nothing.
MODULE: AuditClassifyFaultAsFailed
TARGET: NoFalseAbsence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a fault that may follow the commit is recorded as a failure
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
        outcome == CASE op[o].result \in {"infra", "undecided"} -> "Pending"
                     [] op[o].result = "domain" -> "Failed"
--- REPLACE
        outcome == CASE op[o].result = "undecided" -> "Pending"
                     [] op[o].result \in {"domain", "infra"} -> "Failed"
--- END
